        <!--
            Libraries the Keycloak distribution already ships in lib/main. They are declared "provided"
            below so that they are compiled against but never copied into target/lib, and therefore never
            land in /opt/keycloak/providers. A second copy on the classpath breaks the server: two
            jakarta.xml.bind-api jars make Hibernate's JAXBContext lookup fail with
            "org.glassfish.jaxb.runtime.v2.JAXBContextFactory not a subtype" during the Quarkus build.

            Keep these aligned with the Keycloak release in ${keycloak.version}. To re-derive the list:
              mvn dependency:list -DincludeScope=runtime
            and compare the artifact ids against `ls /opt/keycloak/lib/lib/main` of the server image.
        -->
